# Trial by Earth (bastok 61): the battlefield. Accepted with the Tuning Fork of Earth, at EP_Entrance the fork opens the
# entry menu 32000; its update with option 1 (index 0, arena 1) registers and enters (the fork taken); Titan_Prime_TBE
# of arena 1 (GALGALIM-3, below every IDs.lua key of the zone) is killed, and the win's 32001 opens within the kill step.
# Its finish runs the battlefield's onEventFinishWin (no title, no XP: nothing) and this quest's handler
# (battlefieldWin 576: the Whisper of Tremors, Heir of the Great Earth). In Port Bastok, Juroro's 252 and option 5
# (10000 gil) complete it.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32001 PortBastok/Juroro/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth accepted
keyitem TuningForkOfEarth
login
trigger EP_Entrance            # the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=1          # Trial by Earth (index 0), arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                         # in the arena
kill GALGALIM-3                # Titan_Prime_TBE of arena 1: the battlefield won, 32001 opens
finish                         # battlefieldWin 576: the Whisper of Tremors, Heir of the Great Earth
warp 32,7,-41 PortBastok
trigger Juroro                 # the whisper: 252
finish option=5                # 10000 gil: completed, the whisper deleted, the Timer set
